<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9209] GridDistributedTxMapping.toString() returns broken string</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9209</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Something wrong with `GridDistributedTxMapping` when we try to get string representation by `GridToStringBuilder`.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It should looks like&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;GridDistributedTxMapping [entries=LinkedHashSet [/*values here*/], explicitLock=false, dhtVer=null, last=false, nearEntries=0,/*more text*/]
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But currently it looks like&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;KeyCacheObjectImpl [part=1, val=1, hasValBytes=false]KeyCacheObjectImpl [part=1, val=1, hasValBytes=false],// more text
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reproducer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;class &lt;/span&gt;GridToStringBuilderSelfTest &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;extends&lt;/span&gt; GridCommonAbstractTest {
    /**
     * @&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;throws&lt;/span&gt; Exception
     */
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; void testGridDistributedTxMapping() &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;throws&lt;/span&gt; Exception {
        IgniteEx ignite = startGrid(0);
        IgniteCache&amp;lt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Integer&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Integer&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt; cache = ignite.createCache(defaultCacheConfiguration());

        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;try&lt;/span&gt; (Transaction tx = ignite.transactions().txStart()) {
            cache.put(1, 1);

            GridDistributedTxMapping mapping = &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; GridDistributedTxMapping(grid(0).localNode());

            assertTrue(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;Wrong string: &quot;&lt;/span&gt; + mapping, mapping.toString().startsWith(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;GridDistributedTxMapping [&quot;&lt;/span&gt;));

            mapping.add(((TransactionProxyImpl)tx).tx().txState().allEntries().stream().findAny().get());

            assertTrue(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;Wrong string: &quot;&lt;/span&gt; + mapping, mapping.toString().startsWith(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;GridDistributedTxMapping [&quot;&lt;/span&gt;));
        }

        stopAllGrids();
    }
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
